  "subject": "🤖 AI Agents Daily — FCA Puts UK AI Agents on Notice: Finance May Need Authorization | November 25, 2026",
  "htmlBody": "<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\">\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <meta name=\"x-apple-disable-message-reformatting\" />\n  <!--[if !mso]><!-->\n  <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\" />\n  <!--<![endif]-->\n  <title>🤖 AI Agents Daily — FCA Puts UK AI Agents on Notice: Finance May Need Authorization | November 25, 2026</title>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#f0f0f0;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;-ms-text-size-adjust:100%;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">\n\n<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ OUTER WRAPPER -->\n<table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#f0f0f0\"\n       style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:24px 10px;\">\n\n      <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>\n      <table width=\"680\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"center\"><tr><td>\n      <![endif]-->\n\n      <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ MAIN CONTAINER -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\"\n             style=\"max-width:680px;border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;box-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.10);border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;\">\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── HEADER -->\n        <tr>\n          <td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\"\n              style=\"padding:40px 30px 28px 30px;border-bottom:2px solid #009c6d;\">\n\n            <!-- Logo emoji -->\n            <div style=\"font-size:40px;line-height:1;margin-bottom:12px;\">🤖</div>\n\n            <!-- Publication title -->\n            <h1 style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:30px;font-weight:bold;color:#1a1a1a;\n                        font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;letter-spacing:-0.5px;\n                        line-height:1.2;\">\n              AI Agents Daily\n            </h1>\n\n            <!-- Tagline -->\n            <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0;font-size:14px;color:#666666;\n                      font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.5;\">\n              AI developments that matter for financial institutions\n            </p>\n\n            <!-- Date -->\n            <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#999999;\n                      font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">\n              November 25, 2026\n            </p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ──────────────────────────────────────── DEEP DIVE SECTION -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:40px 30px 0 30px;\">\n\n            <!-- Section header -->\n            <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 22px 0;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;\n                        font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.3;\">\n              Deep Dive 🔍\n            </h2>\n\n            <!-- Deep dive article title -->\n            <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 18px 0;font-size:21px;font-weight:bold;color:#1a1a1a;\n                        font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;line-height:1.4;\">\n              FCA Puts UK AI Agents on Notice: Finance May Need Authorization\n            </h3>\n\n            <!-- Deep dive article body (HTML from Claude, inline-styled by email-builder) -->\n            <div style=\"font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;\n                        font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">\n              <h3 style=\"margin:24px 0 10px 0;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding-bottom:8px;\">Overview</h3><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">The UK's Financial Conduct Authority has issued a formal statement declaring that AI agents executing payments, brokering credit, or delivering investment advice in UK markets likely require authorization — a landmark regulatory signal landing just as <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxOa3ZObHZRMmhBQmdBYThPVzFPZU1KTDlFd1lNMVAtUDMwQlRfYUlXRlVtUzVYMjA0cjg3Q1d2eXBDUnk2VGh5dFZ5Y25MN1VpX1IzWlZXbk5WMFBpT3lGYllfczgtSS00RVJKYmFsNU1xLWR5OENMQTBDcnRaMmZHUlQzNFN2c0xyR0liMEdOV1U?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:none;\">Meta launches its adapted Muse AI assistant</a> into the UK market.</p><h3 style=\"margin:24px 0 10px 0;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding-bottom:8px;\">The Details</h3><ul style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;padding:0 0 0 20px;font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">FCA issued a formal statement specifically addressing AI agent deployment in regulated UK financial services</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Activities flagged as potentially requiring authorization: payments execution, credit broking, and investment advice carried out by AI agents</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">The statement coincides with Meta rolling out its Muse AI assistant, adapted for UK users</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Authorization requirements may apply even where the underlying firm is already FCA-regulated — the agent's actions matter, not just the firm's status</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">The FCA's framing signals intent to treat AI agents as principals under regulated activity rules, not simply tools</li></ul><h3 style=\"margin:24px 0 10px 0;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding-bottom:8px;\">Why It Matters</h3><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">Every UK bank, insurer, and payments firm building or deploying AI agents must now conduct a legal review of whether those agents' activities fall within the authorization perimeter. <strong>The FCA is effectively saying: if the agent does the work of a regulated function, the authorization rules follow the function</strong> — regardless of how much human oversight is claimed upstream.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">Globally, other regulators are watching the FCA closely. What the FCA articulates today about AI agent authorization is likely to echo in MAS, ASIC, and ECB guidance within 12 months. Financial institutions operating across jurisdictions should treat this as an early warning to begin mapping agentic AI deployments against each regulator's authorization perimeter now — before enforcement guidance firms up.</p>\n            </div>\n\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────── DIVIDER: Deep Dive → Things to Know -->\n        <tr>\n          <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:36px 0;\">\n            <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>\n            <table width=\"340\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"center\"><tr>\n            <td height=\"3\" bgcolor=\"#009c6d\" style=\"font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td>\n            </tr></table>\n            <![endif]-->\n            <!--[if !mso]><!-->\n            <div style=\"width:50%;height:3px;background-color:#009c6d;margin:0 auto;\"></div>\n            <!--<![endif]-->\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────── THINGS TO KNOW SECTION -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 30px 0 30px;\">\n\n            <!-- Section header -->\n            <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 22px 0;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;\n                        font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.3;\">\n              Things to Know 👀\n            </h2>\n\n            <!-- Things to Know entries injected by email-builder -->\n            \n      <!-- TTK entry 1 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            1. <strong>Rabobank Selects nCino to Transform Business Lending with Agentic AI Platform</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxOSl9wTzFad0Y2MTdHcWdHNXNxQjZnc1c2WWhjX0h2WFd6YnU4ZWxwQTdQckJ1UGZ2SFdsY2FkMVJBZGFkUS1UcVBkZm5FVVNxMk5PMHpsaXVfd2pNcEc4MVVnRzdSMXNBRmVUUnhBU3M5YU9IX09jQjZCZXhJYU9OUWZXMXEzV2xVeEgwRmNpMmRLalJkWHEwNTFNOWxZNkNjMGg0?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">FF News</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            Rabobank has selected nCino's agentic AI platform to transform its business lending operations, integrating automated decisioning into the loan lifecycle across its commercial banking division.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>Agentic lending moves from pilot to production at a major bank.</strong> This is one of the most concrete deployments of agentic AI in core commercial credit — a proof point that autonomous decisioning in lending is now operationally viable.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 2 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            2. <strong>Anthropic unveils Claude Duet, an AI assistant that keeps working even when you're away</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">Firstpost</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            Anthropic has unveiled Claude Duet, an AI assistant that continues executing tasks autonomously in the background even when the user steps away from their session — enabling long-running workflows without constant supervision.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>Background execution changes enterprise AI oversight calculus.</strong> For financial services, an AI persisting through compliance and analysis workflows without real-time human supervision raises urgent questions about auditability, error detection, and regulatory accountability.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 3 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            3. <strong>Financial AI Shifts from Prediction to Delegated Decision-Making Under New Framework</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxPaVlNTlJLNlBnXy1wR0NLaVU1RlBXcXB0X0lUYi13bktTNG9wYTdLLXpncUpOazZIcy1QcXVHRG03Z2hpN3NYWG5UajFzVVpOd0dONzZld0tCX0FpVlJHRWtHWm8tbFhHa2x3LTM2WkVELW8yTFYzRVZrOXBoN2FMSHk5LVVTMWE2UXRkMmhRLXlUNzVYSy1qTE52d1k5NGRIMy1LRDAzU1BmX2I5eVE?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">Bioengineer.org</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            A new framework describes financial AI evolving from predictive analytics toward delegated decision-making, where AI systems are formally granted authority to act on behalf of financial institutions without per-action human sign-off.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>Delegation, not prediction, is the next compliance frontier.</strong> Banks will need new approval frameworks, liability structures, and audit trails for AI-delegated decisions — existing model risk management guidance was not built for this.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 4 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            4. <strong>ABA Fraudcast: How Citizens Bank defends against AI-powered attacks</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://bankingjournal.aba.com/2026/11/aba-fraudcast-how-citizens-bank-defends-against-ai-powered-attacks/\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">ABA Banking Journal</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            Citizens Bank shares its strategy for defending against AI-powered fraud attacks, covering cross-industry data-sharing challenges between platforms, telecoms, and banks, and the growing risk of consumer overconfidence in AI-driven security systems.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>AI is now both weapon and shield in bank fraud.</strong> As attackers use AI-generated deepfakes and synthetic identities at scale, effective defense requires coordinated data sharing across sectors — and financial institutions cannot rely on consumer vigilance alone.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 5 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            5. <strong>Anthropic's Dario Amodei calls accusations of surrendering human control to AI 'absurd'</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/25/anthropics-dario-amodei-calls-accusations-of-surrendering-human-control-to-ai-absurd/\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">TechCrunch</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            Anthropic CEO Dario Amodei publicly rejected rival claims that his company is surrendering human agency to AI, even as leading AI companies — including Anthropic — increasingly automate their own research and model development processes.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>Human control is now a competitive and procurement battleground.</strong> Banks choosing AI vendors will face harder governance questions about where vendor commitments to human oversight actually hold — and where they quietly give way.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Spacer after last entry -->\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:4px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────── DIVIDER: Things to Know → Startups -->\n        <tr>\n          <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:36px 0;\">\n            <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>\n            <table width=\"340\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"center\"><tr>\n            <td height=\"3\" bgcolor=\"#009c6d\" style=\"font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td>\n            </tr></table>\n            <![endif]-->\n            <!--[if !mso]><!-->\n            <div style=\"width:50%;height:3px;background-color:#009c6d;margin:0 auto;\"></div>\n            <!--<![endif]-->\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────── AGENTIC STARTUPS SECTION -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 30px 0 30px;\">\n\n            <!-- Section header -->\n            <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 22px 0;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;\n                        font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.3;\">\n              Agentic Startups to Watch 🚀\n            </h2>\n\n            <!-- Startup entries injected by email-builder -->\n            \n      <!-- Startup entry 1 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Company name + tagline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            <strong>1. <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxPOHoyUHBlZUNQeFhXc1hDTXlkQVpubm9WQWo2TXF3bFZWalh5RDdicGh4bmNaQ1RQdVpQTmltaVJQVDVtNE5nc05NZmhXRXlzcEpJS2VhM2NYX0dwYXZqRXBGZzl6QVFwdnB6bl9fQ3lFUWtOVlFVU3lrTDhGcXBaS1pKRE1pVERBUkJNa3M3RHpGMVB4WGl6bllEaDlnOFJu?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:none;\">Arva AI</a></strong> &mdash; <strong>Agentic AI platform automating critical banking operations end-to-end</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            Arva AI has secured $20 million to bring agentic AI to core banking workflows, targeting operations that have traditionally required manual review and human intervention.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Analysis bullet -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:10px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;\">\n            🧠 <strong>Purpose-built for banking's operational backbone.</strong> Unlike general-purpose agents, Arva targets back-office and compliance-intensive processes — areas where accuracy, auditability, and regulatory alignment are table stakes for any financial institution to actually deploy.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Spacer + rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:20px 0 20px 0;\">